<title>UK: Dresdner Finance sets 150 mln stg five-year bond.</title>
<headline>Dresdner Finance sets 150 mln stg five-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Dresdner Kleinwort Benson.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DRESDNER FINANCE BV</p>
<p>GUARANTOR  DRESDNER BANK AG</p>
<p> AMT    150 MLN STG   COUPON     7.375     MATURITY    24.JUL.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.456   PAY DATE    24.JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     REOFFER    99.831    SPREAD	+12 BP</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  =	   LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p>DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/GE/NL</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   STD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.25	SELL CONC  1.0	 PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 7.0 PCT JUNE 2002 GILT</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
